{"exportedAt":"2026-07-27T09:43:51.071Z","goal":{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a67284a91815bf735ca3a22","startDate":1785110400000,"endDate":1794700800000,"durationInWeeks":16,"competitionDate":1794700800000,"goalType":"half-marathon","break":"without","paid":true,"stats":{"trainingsCount":118,"trainingsDoneCount":0,"distanceTotal":0,"timeTotal":0},"status":"ongoing","isEditable":true,"sessionCompetitionInfo":{"sessionCompetition":{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SEMI-MARATHON","description":"Le semi-marathon récompense la patience. Les premiers kilomètres doivent te sembler confortables et sous contrôle. Ne te laisse pas influencer par les autres coureurs : cours ta propre course. Concentre-toi sur ton allure, ton hydratation et tes sensations. Si tu as bien géré la première partie, tu pourras profiter pleinement de la seconde. Tu as accumulé les kilomètres et les semaines d'entraînement pour être prêt(e) aujourd'hui. Fais-toi confiance et profite de l'expérience !","displayName":"SEMI-MARATHON","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":259,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":5464,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a67285124561a45f7ced365","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1794182400000,"sessionIndex":3,"choRecommendation":4,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"YbBFRyt1QkiVKE6SJD1x-Q","name":"Compote de pommes énergétique","form":"semi-liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":2,"metr