on":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"La 3ème semaine d'un cycle d'entraînement, c'est celle où les séances d'intensité sont les plus dures... et en même temps là où la fatigue est la plus importante... profite du footing pour écouter tes sensations et estimer ton niveau de fatigue. Si tu le sens vraiment haut, mets les bouchées doubles sur la récup en rentrant (voir ici pour approfondir le sujet : https://www.running-addict.fr/conseil-running/sentrainer-regresser-la-recuperation-fait-progresser/ )","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EnduForce_600_3","description":"Séance d'endurance de force en deux blocs. Il y a 3 intervalles par bloc, respectivement de 40\", 30\" et 20\", séparés par 3' de repos courues très lentement et/ou marchés. À la fin du premier bloc, après le dernier sprint de 20\", prends 5' *(soit 2' de bonus !)* activement afin de pouvoir repartir sur le second bloc avec autant d'intensité que sur le premier.","displayName":"Endurance de Force","coachAdvice":"Si tu fais tes séances de sprints toujours au même endroit, prends des repères. Tu devrais savoir quelle distance tu es capable d'atteindre en fonction du nombre de secondes. Et semaine après semaine, essaie de repousser cette distance.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":9.131730374049752,"expectedDuration":3300},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":40,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":20,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":40,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":20,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_70_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 4 séries. Chaque série est constituée de 2' d'endurance active, suivies par 2' Tempo, puis 2' Sweetspot pour terminer avec 1' de récupération avant de commencer la série suivante.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Une autre \"petite\" sortie longue de 1h10. On sait que ça parait peu pour certains... Le fait est qu'en dehors d'un prépa spécifique semi ou marathon, pas besoin d'en faire beaucoup plus, on se concentre sur les entraînements du coeur de la semaine !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_30","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Aerobie","value":318,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"aerobie"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":300,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":2,