Stats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un bon footing, il n'y a que ça de vrai pour évacuer le stress ou tout simplement profiter pour s'évader de ton quotidien, profite de ton environnement et pense au plaisir simple que la course t'apporte ! Ça fait du bien de te recentrer sur les petits plaisirs simples de temps en temps ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"duratio