false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.0588235294117645,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Footing / lignes droites, c'est un classique des coureurs ! Ça ne fatigue pas mais ça permet de garder le corps en mode \"entraînement\". Pas de rythme précis sur les lignes droites, vas y progressivement, selon tes sensations !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exercise