isplayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'envie d'accélérer sur les footings ? Elle est naturelle, on l'a tous car le footing c'est facile ! Mais il faut absolument te retenir de le faire si tu veux progresser ! Courir plus vite, c'est générer de la fatigue (même un peu) qui va t'empêcher d'être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci ! (je me répète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1792368000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9411764705882355,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"On accompagne ce footing de quelques lignes droites pour te garder actif dans ta foulée ! Quand tu accélères le rythme, tous tes muscles / tes tendons / tes articulations sont sollicités de manière un peu plus intense et vont ainsi se détendre. C'est contre-intuitif mais comme l'effort est rapide mais pas maximal et qu'il est court, ça ne génère pas de fatigue, juste du positif pour ta foulée !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":593,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1792368000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.811349124721336,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":325}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":240,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessio